  "en": null,
  "chapter": "Watch — Police Force",
  "caption_extra": "Suggested dietary.—The following dietary is proposed. The Soya bean is substituted for the red bean, the amount of onions and cabbage is doubled, 1 oz. of lard is added, and the ration of ¼ oz. of bean oil is increased to 1 oz. (no column headings printed; 'Item' and 'Quantity' supplied by the transcriber)",
  "parts": [
   {
    "label": null,
    "columns": [
     "Item",
     "Quantity"
    ],
    "row_labels": [
     "Rice",
     "Wheat",
     "Soya bean",
     "Green bean",
     "Onions",
     "Cabbage",
     "Bean oil",
     "Lard"
    ],
    "rows": 8
   }
  ],
  "footnotes": [
   "Beef, pork, fish and soya beans on successive days, 1½ ozs. The Newchwang Soya bean is richest in fat and should be used. The estimated constituents of the new diet are as follows:—"
  ]
